# Fully derived MEALS outputs that are cheap to recompute. Both are rewritten in
# full on every run, and keeping them in git history means adding tens of
# megabytes per run without a single new fact. The per-asset metrics do stay in
# the repository: they depend only on the bars and cost a full pipeline run,
# whereas these two are seconds on top of them.
#
#   events/    - the event export of §6.5. The schema lives in
#                schema/event_export.schema.json and is versioned; the export
#                itself is produced by python -m meals.export.
#   residuals/ - the SAED residual series. Restored by python -m meals.saed,
#                which in the run order comes before cluster and export
#                anyway.
data/meals/events/
data/meals/residuals/
